        "markdown": "**Query \u00b7 OBTS BeaverTail 3 - postinstall beacon in Zeek**\n```\nindex=macos sourcetype=macos:eslogger es_event=exec process_path=\"/bin/sh\" target_name=node cmdline=\"*postinstall*\"\n| eval src_ip=host_ip, postinstall_time=_time, postinstall=cmdline\n| fields src_ip postinstall_time postinstall\n| append [ search index=zeek ((sourcetype=bro:dns:json NOT query=\"*.test\") OR (sourcetype=bro:conn:json NOT id.resp_h=10.* NOT id.resp_p=53) OR sourcetype=bro:ssl:json) | eval src_ip='id.orig_h' ]\n| eventstats min(postinstall_time) AS postinstall_time values(postinstall) AS postinstall by src_ip\n| where isnotnull(uid) AND _time>=postinstall_time AND _time<=postinstall_time+120\n| eval seconds_after=round(_time-postinstall_time, 3)\n| table _time seconds_after sourcetype src_ip query answers id.resp_h id.resp_p server_name orig_bytes resp_bytes uid postinstall\n| sort _time\n```"
