        "markdown": "**Query \u00b7 OBTS BeaverTail 3b - Where every lifecycle-script node went**\n```\nindex=macos sourcetype=macos:eslogger es_event=exec process_path=\"/bin/sh\" target_name=node\n| eval src_ip=host_ip, script_time=_time, script=cmdline\n| fields src_ip script_time script host_short\n| append [ search index=zeek sourcetype=bro:dns:json NOT query=\"*.test\" NOT query=\"*.arpa\" | eval src_ip='id.orig_h' ]\n| eventstats values(host_short) AS mac values(script_time) AS script_times by src_ip\n| where isnotnull(query) AND isnotnull(script_times)\n| eval script_time=mvindex(mvmap(script_times, if(_time - script_times >= 0 AND _time - script_times <= 15, script_times, null())), 0)\n| where isnotnull(script_time)\n| stats min(_time) AS first_lookup values(answers) AS answers by mac script_time query\n| eval script_time=strftime(script_time, \"%F %T.%3N\")\n| eval first_lookup=strftime(first_lookup, \"%F %T.%3N\")\n```"
