      "options": {
        "markdown": "**Query \u00b7 OBTS SSH 2 - SSH sessions in Zeek alongside ES**\n```\nindex=zeek sourcetype=bro:conn:json id.resp_p=22\n| lookup mac_hosts host_ip AS id.resp_h OUTPUT host_short AS dest_mac\n| lookup mac_hosts host_ip AS id.orig_h OUTPUT host_short AS src_mac\n| table _time src_mac id.orig_h dest_mac id.resp_h duration conn_state orig_bytes resp_bytes uid\n```"
      }
    },
